  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡El mejor conjunto,\npara ti!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006C0020006D0065006A006F007200200063006F006E006A0075006E0074006F002C000A0070006100720061002000740069002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así es, soy la mejor en esto de la moda.\n¡Nadie conjunta como yo en todo el mundo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y mi nuevo proyecto es nada más y nada\nmenos que...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020006D00690020006E007500650076006F002000700072006F0079006500630074006F0020006500730020006E0061006400610020006D00E10073002000790020006E006100640061000A006D0065006E006F00730020007100750065002E002E002E00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tú!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400FA002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y para celebrar que nos hemos conocido,\nte voy a preparar un modelito sensacional!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero no te preocupes!\n¡El conjunto te lo presto yo, y gratis!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F0020006E006F0020007400650020007000720065006F006300750070006500730021000A00A10045006C00200063006F006E006A0075006E0074006F0020007400650020006C006F002000700072006500730074006F00200079006F002C002000790020006700720061007400690073002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué me dices, cielo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006D0065002000640069006300650073002C0020006300690065006C006F003F00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Quiero hacer de ti toda una estrella de la moda\nde los pies a la cabeza!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me encantaría",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500200065006E00630061006E00740061007200ED00610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, gracias",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C002000670072006100630069006100730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Cómo? ¡Con la de posibilidades que se abren\ncuando otra persona elige tus conjuntos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eso sí, hay una condición.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Puedes cambiarte de ropa cuando quieras,\npero me tendrás que devolver mi conjunto! ¿Vale?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entendido",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00740065006E006400690064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mejor no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006A006F00720020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muy bien, allá vamos!\n¡El mejor conjunto, para ti!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D007500790020006200690065006E002C00200061006C006C00E1002000760061006D006F00730021000A00A10045006C0020006D0065006A006F007200200063006F006E006A0075006E0074006F002C00200070006100720061002000740069002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si es que nadie me supera en esto! ¡Ahora eres\núnic<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa en toda Ciudad Luminalia, chéri<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues hala, el conjunto es todo tuyo hasta mañana\npor la mañana, ¡que lo disfrutes! ¡Hasta pronto!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres devolver el conjunto prestado?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00510075006900650072006500730020006400650076006F006C00760065007200200065006C00200063006F006E006A0075006E0074006F00200070007200650073007400610064006F003F00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Devolver",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650076006F006C0076006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mejor no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006A006F00720020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si no devuelves el conjunto, no podrás comprar\nmás ropa o accesorios.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006E006F002000640065007600750065006C00760065007300200065006C00200063006F006E006A0075006E0074006F002C0020006E006F00200070006F0064007200E1007300200063006F006D0070007200610072000A006D00E1007300200072006F007000610020006F002000610063006300650073006F00720069006F0073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
